MRMS = multi-radar multi-sensor system
  NOAAA National  Severe Storm Laboratory

Original MRMS grib table was obtained from their website and converted by "hand".
  wgrib2 2.0.3: 11/2015

3/2025: Manfred Schwarb wrote get_mrms.sh to download the MRMS gribtable (thanks Manfred)
  from Nat. Severe Storm Lab. (NSSL) github site.

--------------
get_mrms.sh is hardwired to retreive UserTable_MRMS_v12.2.csv
This will have to be changed to retrieve future versions of the mrms grib table.
------------------
3/2025: steps used to update MRMS_gribtable.dat

  ./get_mrms.sh MRMS_gribtable                   -- downloads, convert and write MRMS_gribtable
  ../../make_gribtable.sh MRMS_gribtable         .. converts MRMS_gribtalbe to MRMS_gribtable.dat
